      <activity id="44c7f483-4419-596c-aed8-ec42023f9a9c" activityNameId="a39a1b60-fd63-5d32-957f-51dc7e5e5954" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Powder coating, steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Powder coating, steel
The powder inventoried is mainly used in exterior architectural applications. The coating thickness is 80 um. The heat consumption is calculated for a sheet of 2 mm thickness.;
UUID: c39b8af5-bc1e-35a1-b724-56750b693aad
Phosphating of the steel sheet, powder coating and heat curing. No transports of the steel sheet to the coating plant or back are inventoried.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Phosphating, coating and heat curing. Treatment of the waste water is assumed.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c39b8af5-bc1e-35a1-b724-56750b693aad.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
